  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/liblnk

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/liblnk/archive/refs/tags/20260525.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack liblnk-20260525-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./liblnk-20260525-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/liblnk-20260525-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liblnk-20260525-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liblnk1-20260525-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liblnk-devel-20260525-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-liblnk-20260525-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(liblnk)
  /usr/bin/lnkinfo.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/liblnk.README
  /usr/share/doc/liblnk/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/liblnk/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/liblnk/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/liblnk/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/liblnk/README
  /usr/share/man/man1/lnkinfo.1.gz

(liblnk1)
  /usr/bin/cyglnk-1.dll

(liblnk-devel)
  /usr/include/liblnk.h
  /usr/include/liblnk/codepage.h
  /usr/include/liblnk/definitions.h
  /usr/include/liblnk/error.h
  /usr/include/liblnk/extern.h
  /usr/include/liblnk/features.h
  /usr/include/liblnk/types.h
  /usr/lib/liblnk.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/liblnk.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/liblnk.3.gz

(python312-liblnk)
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pylnk.dll

